[h2]Build 0.9.5[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]All-new power suit art in the style of a classic T-60: a T-faced helmet with a head lamp, breather and cheek filters, brown breathing hoses, huge angular pauldrons, a broad chest plate, belt and hip plates, and a power core with a valve wheel on the back. Drawn the RimWorld way, like the warcaskets - no arms or legs.
[*]A suit's paint job now covers only its armour plates: the gunmetal frame, hoses, lamp and lenses keep their own colours.
[*]New "Climb out" button icon and mod preview.
[/list]
